766/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まだ衣装解禁されてないから隠した～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天ゴルフ部見てくれましたかぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強化合宿で少しは成長できたんじゃないかと我々部員は思っとります～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃハードなスケジュールだったけど結果オーライでいい合宿だったなぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに１日目の最後に回ったホールでは\n部員の中で１位でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからももっと上手くなるように頑張りますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files