,"src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0028.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節外れのサンタさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして松井玲奈さんの卒業発表！\n正直びっくりしました！\n玲奈さんは何に対しても全部に全力投球で忙しいのに乃木坂に兼任できてくださってライブにも出てくださって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前もすぐ覚えてくれたのはほんとに嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブしてる時のレナさん！ほんとに素敵なアイドルでキャピキャピしてて！はじけた笑顔大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホントに感謝することばかりです！\n寂しいけど、卒業の時はおめでとう！って笑顔で言いたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂にも遊びに来て欲しいなっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(○･ω･)ﾉ-------------end-------------BYE"}],"source":"archive"}